   "message": "btw i listened to a podcast with daniel kahneman today and he said intuition depends on the frame\n\nhe and gary klein did research on intuition specifically, they are literally intuition experts\n\nso they think the frame (or \"narrative\") is what decides \n\nso if the frame changes the landscape that your intuition is in changes\n\nso the conclusions that are on a mountain vs in a valley changes",
