   "message": "i think the reason why omar is using the word reality is to distinguish it from an alternative more theoretical space that change can happen in\n\nand i think i observe this too\n\nand i think the example i gave is a real example of two minds operating in the two different spaces\n\nit is a stark and unexpected difference in how the rationalist's mind works vs my own\n\n> best way I can say it is \"it only updates when something is observed in reality\"\nmy friend's opinion or sense of the situation does not rely on intuition so becoming aware of new info did not matter to him, since his logical propositions didn't change",
